	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-gypsum":				"二水硫酸钙。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-fluorite":				"发出一种非常微弱的辉光。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-hematite":				"也被称为红赭石。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-ilmenite":				"使玻璃的颜色看起来更浓郁明亮。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-kernite":				"可用于制造硼砂。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-limonite":				"也称为黄赭石或金赭石。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-litharge":				"它曾被称为密陀僧。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-magnesiumoxide":			"氧化镁（MgO），又称烧镁。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-manganesedioxide":			"二氧化锰 (MnO₂)。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-manganeseviolet":			"<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>温莎牛顿，纽伦堡。</i></font><br>",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-magnetite":				"光线在这种深黑色粉末上仍然闪烁。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-malachite":				"粉末状孔雀石矿石。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-pentlandite":				"焙烧以除去硫化物，得到镍。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-phosphorite":				"发出非常微弱的白色光芒。<br><br>不要吸入！",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-prussianblue":			"<font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>国王的卫兵骄傲地穿着他们的蓝色外套，直到死亡。</i></font><br>",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-redphosphorus":			"散发出淡淡的红色光芒。<br><br>不要吸入！",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-rhodochrosite":			"赋予玻璃和陶瓷釉料粉红色、紫色或深绿色。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-soda":				"碳酸钠，也称为纯碱。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-ultramarine":				"青金石，研磨成细粉。",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-whitephosphorus":			"在黑暗中发光。不要吸入！",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-whitelead":				"白色颜料。<br><br><font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>……他们将铅片放入盛有浓醋的罐子中，用粪便和废单宁覆盖它们，并将它们放置三个两周……</i></font>",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-yellowcake":				"浓缩氧化铀。<br><br><font color=\"#99c9f9\"><i>不要吃那个黄色的蛋糕。</i></font>",
	"em:itemdesc-powdered-ore-zincoxide":				"又称锌白。亮白色油漆和釉料的成分。",

	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered":			"用作颜料给各种产品染色和着色。",

	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-copper":	"如果与石灰混合，可以产生蓝色或绿色。仅用铜就能制造深红色、不透明的玻璃。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-gold":		"适用于釉料和涂层。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-lead":		"焙烧铅会产生氧化铅，这是亮黄色和红色颜料的基础。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-nickel":	"可用于制造深蓝色、黑色或紫色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-rusty":	"产生绿色、棕色、灰色甚至黑色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-silver":	"适用于釉料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-tin":		"加热锡会把它变成氧化锡，一种用于釉料的白色粉末。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-uranium":	"对于制造发出黄色或绿色光芒的物体可能很有用。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-metal-zinc":		"可能有助于涂覆其他金属以提高其耐腐蚀性。",


	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-stone-bauxite":	"含有氧化铝和微量氧化铁。它们可以产生橙色或红色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-stone-granite":	"粉末状花岗岩是瓷器的重要原料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-stone-obsidian":	"对于深色玻璃颜色很有用。",

	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-boneash":		"是制作优质瓷器、乳白色釉料和乳白色玻璃的重要成分。也可用作肥料。<br>用<a href=\"handbook://item-coke\">焦炭</a>加热，将其还原为<a href=\"handbook://item-em:powdered-ore-whitephosphorus\">白磷</a>。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cadmiumsulfide":		"产生鲜艳的黄色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cadmiumselenide":	"产生鲜艳的红色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cadmiumsulfoselenide":	"产生鲜艳的橙色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cadmiumgreen":		"产生鲜艳的绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cassiterite":		"产生白色并使混合物变得不透明。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-chromite":		"加热时会变成氧化铬，呈现鲜艳的绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-chromiumoxide":		"粉末状氧化铬，也称为铬绿。在染料、釉料和玻璃中产生浓郁深邃的绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cinnabar":		"产生深红色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-coal":			"可用作黑色颜料和制造炸弹。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cobaltblue":		"用作彩色玻璃、釉料、染料和油漆的蓝色颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cobaltgreen":		"用作彩色玻璃、釉料、染料和耐光油漆的绿色颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cobaltsulfate":		"用作彩色玻璃、釉料、染料和油漆的红色颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-copperoxide":		"氧化铜(II)，也称为黑铜。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-corundum":		"刚玉由数千个微小的锋利晶体组成，非常适合抛光最坚硬的表面。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cupronickel":		"铜和镍的混合物，通常通过添加微量铁和锰来强化。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-cuprorivaite":		"一种浅蓝色粉末，用于染料制造和作为颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-fluorite":		"在玻璃制造和釉料中可代替硼砂。增加发光材料的辉光。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-electrum":		"它有什么用处？",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-galena":			"焙烧方铅矿会去除硫化物并产生粉末状氧化铅，这是亮黄色和红色颜料的基础。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-graphite":		"粉末状石墨用于陶瓷和电子元件。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-gypsum":			"与少量水混合可变成<a href=\"handbook://block:plaster-plain\">石膏</a>。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-hematite":		"粉末状氧化铁，产生橙色或红色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-ilmenite":		"原钛可以添加到玻璃配料中以产生更深的颜色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-indigo":			"产生一种强效蓝色染料，无需媒染剂即可给布料染色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-iodine":			"一种防腐剂。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-kernite":		"用水密封在桶中，将其变成硼砂。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-lapislazuli":		"将青金石研磨成细粉。产生深蓝色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-leadoxide":		"红色和黄色氧化铅的混合物。小心地加热和冷却会将其变成亮黄色和红色颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-limonite":		"粉末状氧化铁，产生黄色或橙色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-litharge":		"一种具有亮红色的氧化铅。<br>用作颜料给各种产品染色和着色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-magnesiumhydroxide":	"是<a href=\"handbook://item-em:powdered-ore-magnesiumoxide\">白镁氧</a>的前体。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-magnesiumoxide":		"产生白色，可用于耐热产品。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-magnetite":		"微磁性的粉末状氧化铁混合物，用于黑色和使玻璃变暗。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-malachite":		"粉末状孔雀石，一种亮绿蓝色的氧化铜混合物，也称为碳酸铜。产生美妙的青色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-manganesedioxide":	"产生黑色或深棕色，并通过去除氧化铁杂质使玻璃脱色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-manganeseoxide":		"产生浓郁深邃的绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-manganeseviolet":	"产生浓郁深邃的紫色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-massicot":		"一种亮黄色的氧化铅。<br>用作颜料为各种产品染色和着色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-olivine":		"产生强烈的绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-pentlandite":		"焙烧镍黄铁矿将去除杂质并产生镍，然后可用于对各种产品进行着色或染色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-picricacid":		"一种爆炸性粉末，小心处理。可用于制造炸药粉、黄色染料或用作防腐剂。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-phosphorite":		"增加黑暗中物体的发光度。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-prussianblue":		"一种深蓝色颜料，产生丰富、耐光的颜色和釉料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-quartz":			"粉末状石英几乎呈白色，是所有玻璃和釉料配方的基础。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-rhodochrosite":		"又称碳酸锰。单独使用它会产生粉红色或紫色色调，与铁一起使用会产生迷人的深绿色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-redphosphorus":		"对于制造发出红色或橙色光芒的物体可能很有用。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-sphalerite":		"硫化锌。焙烧会去除硫并产生<a href=\"handbook://item-em:powdered-metal-zinc\">粉末状锌</a>。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-soda":			"纯碱晶体可用于生产<a href=\"handbook://item-em:washingsodaportion\">洗涤碱</a>或<a href=\"handbook://item-em:causticsodaportion\">碱液</a>。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-titaniumdioxide":	"一种亮白色颜料，用于给玻璃和釉料着色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-ultramarine":		"产生深蓝色或紫色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-vermillion":		"与蓝色组合时可产生深橙色和红色，或紫色。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-whitephosphorus":	"可能有助于制造发出明亮光芒的物体。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-whitelead":		"用作釉料和白玻璃的颜料。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-yellowcake":		"一种强颜料，可使玻璃在黑暗中发出黄色或绿色的光。",
	"game:handbook-item-usage-powdered-ore-zincoxide":		"用作染料、釉料和玻璃中的白色颜料。",

	"em:item-cobaltsulfateportion":					"硫酸钴",
	"em:incontainer-item-cobaltsulfateportion":			"硫酸钴",

	"em:item-dilutedsaltpeterportion":				"硝石盐水",
	"em:incontainer-item-dilutedsaltpeterportion":			"硝石盐水",

	"em:item-dilutedkerniteportion":				"四水硼砂溶液",
	"em:incontainer-item-dilutedkerniteportion":			"四水硼砂溶液",

	"em:item-causticpotashportion":					"氢氧化钾溶液",
	"em:incontainer-item-causticpotashportion":			"氢氧化钾溶液",
	"em:itemdesc-causticpotashportion":				"苛性钾溶液，一种非常强的碱。可中和酸、还原大多数材料。小心处理。",
	"game:itemdesc-slakedlimeportion":				"一种弱碱。用于制作灰泥。",

	"em:item-washingsodaportion":					"洗涤碱",
	"em:incontainer-item-washingsodaportion":			"洗涤碱",
	"em:itemdesc-washingsodaportion":				"一种弱碱，可用于清洁和制造肥皂。",

	"em:item-causticsodaportion":					"烧碱液",
	"em:incontainer-item-causticsodaportion":			"烧碱液",
	"em:itemdesc-causticsodaportion":				"氢氧化钠，也称苛性钠，一种非常强的碱。小心处理。",

	"game:itemdesc-powder-iron-raw":				"会慢慢变成铁锈。",
	"game:itemdesc-powder-iron-oxide":				"常见的锈。"
}
